        "Avoid excessively low tension that reduces directional precision.",
        "String construction affects feel more than small tension changes."
      ]
    },

    "gauge": {
      "preferred_direction": "Medium or Slightly Thinner",

      "examples": [
        "1.30 → 1.25 mm",
        "1.25 → 1.23 mm"
      ],

      "tradeoff": "Very thin gauges improve feel but may reduce durability."
    }
  },

